    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Government of Tanzania, through the Ministry of Education, Science and Technology, has emphasized the critical role of inter-university collaboration as a catalyst for knowledge generation, innovation, and sustainable development. Such partnerships, it emphasized, are essential for safeguarding future generations.",
